@startuml
!theme plain
title Inspectra - Flow Lifecycle State Machine

[*] --> NEW : First Packet Observed (5-Tuple Registered)

NEW --> ESTABLISHED : 3-Way Handshake (SYN -> SYN-ACK -> ACK)
NEW --> CLASSIFIED : Immediate L7 Data (UDP / Pre-handshake)
NEW --> BLOCKED : Source IP / Port on Blacklist
NEW --> CLOSED : RST Received

ESTABLISHED --> CLASSIFIED : Payload Dissected (TLS SNI / HTTP / DNS)
ESTABLISHED --> BLOCKED : Policy Deny Triggered
ESTABLISHED --> CLOSED : RST Received / FIN Handshake

CLASSIFIED --> BLOCKED : App / Domain Blacklisted
CLASSIFIED --> CLOSED : Normal Teardown (FIN + ACK) or RST

BLOCKED --> BLOCKED : Future Packets Dropped
BLOCKED --> CLOSED : TCP RST Received

CLOSED --> [*] : Stale Timeout (> 300s) or LRU Eviction

@enduml
